- cleaned wellhead and moonpool area.
- screened slops</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-03-12T17:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-03-12T19:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>operation failed</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Waiting on MDN. Unable to proceed with WL operation due to ongoing 5-yearly work on tension cylinders in moonpool.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-03-12T19:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-03-13T00:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- rig up/down</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Waited on Mærsk Production to shut in well and inflow test HMV to 119-5 bar/10 min and DHSV to 119-5 bar/30 min. Had 0.7 bar drop/10 min on HMV and 0.3 bar drop/30 min on DHSV. Bled off pressure to 0 bar above DHSV. Isolated HMV. Confirmed valve status and handed over well to drilling at midnight.

Meanwhile cleaned in moonpool area and injected slop. Held tool box meeting for RD lubricator, LD toolstring and performe dual lift of WL riser. Sorted out problem with exhaust fumes on drillfloor.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity>
